# Publish to test

After a visible app change that passes `node tools/test_all.js` and a version bump, always commit (if needed) and push to the Store channel branch `test` (`origin/test`). Do not wait for a separate push ask.

- Working branch may be `store-publish` tracking `origin/test`; push updates that remote.
- Still never SSH-install, never write the head unit, never force-push, never commit `oap-sdk/`, `*.mgu`, keys, VIN, or HU logs.
- `scripts/publish.ps1` only describes the Store plan; the Store sees the push.
